WEBVTT

00:07.517 --> 00:08.896
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:08.965 --> 00:10.448
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.551 --> 00:12.103
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.137 --> 00:14.068
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.137 --> 00:17.103
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:17.137 --> 00:19.103
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.206 --> 00:21.103
Kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.206 --> 00:23.034
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:23.103 --> 00:24.965
kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:25.000 --> 00:27.172
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.241 --> 00:28.827
kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:28.896 --> 00:31.206
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.275 --> 00:33.103
kids: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
孩子们：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.206 --> 00:35.034
All:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.103 --> 00:37.172
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.241 --> 00:39.068
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.137 --> 00:40.517
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.586 --> 00:42.344
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.413 --> 00:45.034
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.103 --> 00:47.344
[flute plays]
[长笛演奏]

00:47.413 --> 00:48.758
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:50.241 --> 00:53.172
[upbeat bluegrass music]
[欢快的蓝草音乐]

00:53.241 --> 01:00.344
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:08.310 --> 01:10.000
- Howdy, folks.
- 大家好。

01:10.103 --> 01:11.655
Merry Christmas.
圣诞快乐。

01:11.724 --> 01:14.310
Why don't y'all
belly up to the beach
为什么你们不
腹部向上到海滩

01:14.379 --> 01:16.034
and sit with me a spell?
和我坐在一起咒语吗？

01:16.103 --> 01:18.689
I've got a Christmas
campfire story
我有一个圣诞节
篝火故事

01:18.793 --> 01:21.275
I reckon you'll want to hear.
我想你会想听的。

01:21.344 --> 01:25.862
This here tale
takes place underwater
这里的故事
发生在水下

01:25.931 --> 01:29.896
in a one-seahorse town
called Bikini Bottom.
在一个只有海马的小镇
称为比基尼泳裤。

01:29.965 --> 01:33.758
[festive music]
[节日音乐]

01:33.827 --> 01:36.103
'Twas the day before Christmas,
那是圣诞节前一天，

01:36.172 --> 01:39.551
and every boy and girl
was ready for Santa...
和每个男孩和女孩
已经为圣诞老人做好准备了……

01:39.620 --> 01:41.551
- Hey!
- 嘿！

01:41.655 --> 01:44.172
- Except one busy squirrel.
- 除了一只忙碌的松鼠。

01:44.241 --> 01:48.068
She was using her science
to toil and tinker,
她正在运用她的科学
辛劳和修补，

01:48.137 --> 01:52.206
but she found this experiment
a bit of a thinker.
但她发现这个实验
有点思想家。

01:52.275 --> 01:53.862
- Aha!
- 啊哈！

01:53.965 --> 01:56.172
A touch of tinsel
ought to do the trick.
一抹金属丝
应该可以解决问题。

01:56.275 --> 01:58.689
Hey, elf Bob.
嘿，小精灵鲍勃。

01:58.758 --> 02:02.103
- Oh, Sandy Claus.
[slurps]
- 哦，桑迪·克劳斯。
[啜饮]

02:02.206 --> 02:04.931
I found the tinsel.
我找到了金属丝。

02:06.379 --> 02:08.275
- Thanks for being
my little elf today.
- 谢谢你的存在
今天我的小精灵。

02:08.344 --> 02:10.827
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

02:10.896 --> 02:12.034
[gasps]
[喘气]

02:12.068 --> 02:13.724
both: Ooh.
两人：哦。

02:16.724 --> 02:18.862
- What's this all for, anyway?
- 这一切到底是为了什么？

02:18.931 --> 02:22.241
- This invention will
revolutionize Christmas.
- 本发明将
彻底改变圣诞节。

02:22.310 --> 02:25.724
I'm fixing to reveal it
to the whole town tonight.
我正准备揭露它
今晚整个城镇。

02:25.827 --> 02:28.724
It'll be my gift
to Bikini Bottom.
这将是我的礼物
到比基尼底部。

02:28.827 --> 02:31.448
[suspenseful music]
[悬疑音乐]

02:31.517 --> 02:34.413
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

02:34.517 --> 02:35.724
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

02:35.827 --> 02:37.344
[defeated music]
[败乐]

02:37.413 --> 02:39.689
[sighs]
- Congratulations, Sandy.
[叹气]
- 恭喜你，桑迪。

02:39.758 --> 02:41.413
- Huh?
- You've done it again.
- 啊？
- 你又做到了。

02:41.517 --> 02:43.172
- No, that ain't right.
- 不，那是不对的。

02:43.241 --> 02:45.379
I gotta do better than that.
我必须做得更好。

02:45.448 --> 02:46.827
I'll need a few more ingredients
我还需要一些配料

02:46.896 --> 02:48.827
if I want this to be ready
in time.
如果我想让这个准备好
及时。

02:48.896 --> 02:50.724
[high-pitched whistle]
[高亢的口哨声]

02:50.827 --> 02:51.965
- What was that?
- 那是什么？

02:52.034 --> 02:54.206
- Was that... no.
- 那是……不。

02:54.275 --> 02:56.862
It can't be.
不可能。

02:56.931 --> 02:59.620
- Slappy, did you
make that noise?
- 斯拉皮，你是吗？
发出那种声音？

02:59.724 --> 03:03.655
- No, but I did make
a new friend.
- 不，但我确实做了
一个新朋友。

03:03.758 --> 03:07.206
[laughter]
[笑声]

03:09.413 --> 03:10.758
- Ugh.
- Yeesh.
- 呃。
- 是的。

03:10.793 --> 03:13.172
Both: Huh?
两人：啊？

03:13.275 --> 03:14.448
- [grunts] Ta-da!
- [咕哝] 哒哒！

03:14.517 --> 03:18.551
- Pa, Ma, Randy, Rowdy,
Rosy, Granny?
-爸爸，妈妈，兰迪，吵闹，
罗西，奶奶？

03:18.620 --> 03:20.724
All: Howdy, Sandy.
全体：你好，桑迪。

03:20.793 --> 03:22.275
- Howdy, y'all.
- 你们好。

03:22.344 --> 03:23.931
- Why didn't you tell me
that you'd invited
- 你为什么不告诉我
你邀请的

03:23.965 --> 03:27.586
your family to Bikini Bottom
for the holidays?
你的家人到比基尼泳裤
假期？

03:27.655 --> 03:29.344
- 'Cause she didn't, SpongeBob.
- 因为她没有，海绵宝宝。

03:29.413 --> 03:32.517
This here's a good old
Texas bushwhack visit.
这是一个很好的老
德克萨斯州丛林之旅。

03:32.586 --> 03:33.551
[laughs]
[笑]

03:33.620 --> 03:34.931
- We had to put a few holes
- 我们必须打几个洞

03:35.000 --> 03:36.379
in the family row boat,
在家庭划艇上，

03:36.448 --> 03:39.827
but it was worth it to see
our little aquatic acorn.
但值得一看
我们的小水生橡子。

03:39.862 --> 03:43.034
- Yeah, sis, we came
all the way from Texas
- 是的，姐姐，我们来了
从德克萨斯州一路过来

03:43.137 --> 03:47.000
just to spend Christmas with
little old smarty-tail you.
只是为了一起过圣诞节
小老聪明尾随你。

03:47.103 --> 03:50.344
- And not at all because
Randy's on the lam again.
- 根本不是因为
兰迪又在逃了。

03:50.413 --> 03:51.793
[siren wailing]
[警笛哀号]

03:51.896 --> 03:54.655
- [yelping]
- [尖叫]

03:54.758 --> 03:56.793
[horn honks]
[喇叭鸣响]

03:56.827 --> 03:58.034
- Is the coast clear?
- 海岸畅通无阻吗？

03:58.103 --> 03:59.517
- Well, shoot.
- 好吧，开枪吧。

03:59.586 --> 04:01.379
If I'd have known
y'all were coming,
如果我知道的话
你们都来了，

04:01.448 --> 04:03.241
I would have put the kettle on.
我会把水壶放上。

04:03.344 --> 04:04.793
- [grunting] Help me, kids.
- [咕哝]帮帮我，孩子们。

04:04.862 --> 04:07.344
- [giggles]
- Tag me out.
- [咯咯笑]
- 标记我出去。

04:07.379 --> 04:09.206
- You need help, Auntie Sandy?
- 你需要帮助吗，桑迪阿姨？

04:09.275 --> 04:12.137
- Make him turn blue.
- 让他变成蓝色。

04:12.206 --> 04:13.620
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

04:13.689 --> 04:14.862
[bell dings]
- Huh?
[铃声]
- 啊？

04:14.965 --> 04:16.689
[foghorn blares]
[雾号声]

04:16.793 --> 04:19.000
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

04:19.068 --> 04:21.241
What in the yellow snow
was that?
黄色的雪里有什么
是吗？

04:21.310 --> 04:23.448
- [chuckles] Sorry.
That was my work alarm.
- [轻笑] 抱歉。
那是我的工作闹钟。

04:23.517 --> 04:25.827
Yoop! Yoink!
哎哟！哟哟！

04:25.896 --> 04:28.551
I got to get to the Krusty Krab
for my favorite shift
我得去 Krusty Krab
我最喜欢的轮班

04:28.655 --> 04:31.965
of the whole year,
Christmas Eve.
全年中，
平安夜。

04:32.034 --> 04:33.620
[bell jingling]
[铃声叮当响]

04:33.689 --> 04:36.034
- Hey, why don't
we all tag along?
- 嘿，为什么不呢
我们都跟着一起吗？

04:36.103 --> 04:37.586
- Oh, we'd just love to.
- 哦，我们很乐意。

04:37.689 --> 04:41.586
We have dearly missed
all our deep-sea buddies.
我们深深地怀念
我们所有的深海伙伴。

04:41.655 --> 04:44.827
[bluegrass music playing]
[蓝草音乐演奏]

04:44.862 --> 04:48.310
[boinging]
[轰鸣声]

04:48.379 --> 04:52.413
- Whoo! Merry Christmas,
Krusty customers.
- 呼！圣诞快乐，
克鲁斯提的顾客。

04:52.517 --> 04:55.068
Aren't the holidays magical?
假期是不是很神奇？

04:55.137 --> 04:57.379
- I think you mean tragical.
- 我认为你的意思是悲剧。

04:57.482 --> 04:59.344
- Who upchucked in your eggnog?
- 谁在你的蛋酒里倒了酒？

04:59.448 --> 05:01.000
[defeated music]
[败乐]

05:01.068 --> 05:04.620
[coins jingling]
[金币叮当作响]

05:04.655 --> 05:06.551
- Sing it again, Mr. Squidward.
- 再唱一遍，章鱼哥先生。

05:06.620 --> 05:08.310
We need more Christmas tips.
我们需要更多圣诞节提示。

05:08.379 --> 05:09.586
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

05:09.689 --> 05:10.793
[clears throat]
[清嗓子]

05:10.896 --> 05:13.275
♪ Krusty Krab, Krusty Krab ♪
♪ 蟹堡蟹，蟹堡蟹 ♪

05:13.344 --> 05:15.413
♪ Eat here every day ♪
♪ 每天都在这里吃饭 ♪

05:15.482 --> 05:18.137
♪ Something, something,
Krabby Patties ♪
♪ 某事，某事，
蟹肉饼♪

05:18.206 --> 05:21.793
♪ Don't forget to pay ♪
♪ 别忘了付款 ♪

05:21.896 --> 05:24.758
- Boo! Boo!
- You stink!
- 嘘！嘘！
- 你太臭了！

05:24.793 --> 05:27.586
- Mr. Krabs,
why do I have to sing?
- 蟹老板先生，
为什么我必须唱歌？

05:27.620 --> 05:30.931
I just play my clarinet instead?
我只是演奏单簧管？

05:31.034 --> 05:32.103
- No can do.
- 没有办法。

05:32.206 --> 05:34.482
I'm using it
as a yule log today.
我正在使用它
作为今天的圣诞日志。

05:34.551 --> 05:35.655
- What?
- 什么？

05:35.724 --> 05:37.482
[screams, groans]
[尖叫声、呻吟声]

05:37.551 --> 05:39.275
[yelping]
[尖叫]

05:41.206 --> 05:44.172
[clarinet playing off-key]
[单簧管走调]

05:46.551 --> 05:48.758
[sighs]
[叹气]

05:48.862 --> 05:49.931
[groans]
[呻吟]

05:50.000 --> 05:52.724
- [laughs]
Howdy, Mr. Krabs.
- [笑]
你好，蟹老板。

05:52.793 --> 05:56.275
You sure have a festive
Christmas caroler there.
你肯定有一个节日
那里有圣诞颂歌。

05:56.310 --> 05:57.448
Bless his heart.
祝福他的心。

05:57.482 --> 05:59.620
- Thank you, Mrs. Cheeks.
- 谢谢你，奇克斯夫人。

05:59.724 --> 06:02.517
He could stand to bring in
a few more tips, though.
他可以忍受引进
不过，还有一些提示。

06:02.620 --> 06:04.827
- Matter of fact,
I'm a little something
- 事实上，
我是个小东西

06:04.862 --> 06:06.793
of a chanteuse myself.
我自己是一名女歌手。

06:06.862 --> 06:09.517
Maybe we could strum up
some tips for you, huh?
也许我们可以弹奏
给你一些建议，嗯？

06:09.586 --> 06:11.758
- As long as I don't have
to pay you.
- 只要我没有
付钱给你。

06:11.827 --> 06:14.724
- SpongeBob, lights, please.
- 海绵宝宝，请亮灯。

06:14.793 --> 06:16.310
[exciting music]
[激动人心的音乐]

06:16.379 --> 06:19.000
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

06:20.000 --> 06:21.965
- ♪ Well ♪
- ♪ 嗯 ♪

06:22.034 --> 06:23.758
- ♪ Christmas is a time
for giving ♪
- ♪ 圣诞节是一个美好的时光
为了给予♪

06:23.827 --> 06:25.655
♪ Christmas is a time
for getting ♪
♪ 圣诞节是一个美好的时光
为了得到♪

06:25.724 --> 06:29.344
♪ Christmas is a time
for many things ♪
♪ 圣诞节是一个美好的时光
对于很多事情♪

06:29.413 --> 06:31.655
♪ You know we love
trapeze flipping ♪
♪ 你知道我们爱
空中飞人翻转♪

06:31.724 --> 06:33.448
♪ Climbing trees
and country living ♪
♪ 爬树
和乡村生活♪

06:33.517 --> 06:36.448
♪ But nothing beats
the gifts that Santa brings ♪
♪ 但没有什么比
圣诞老人带来的礼物♪

06:36.517 --> 06:37.482
- ♪ Yahoo ♪
- ♪ 雅虎 ♪

06:37.551 --> 06:39.241
- ♪ Well, Christmas will come ♪
- ♪ 好吧，圣诞节即将到来 ♪

06:39.310 --> 06:41.344
♪ And Christmas will go ♪
♪ 圣诞节即将过去 ♪

06:41.448 --> 06:45.379
♪ But I can't deny
it's the day I love the most ♪
♪ 但我无法否认
这是我最喜欢的一天♪

06:45.482 --> 06:47.000
♪ Everything's a-glowing ♪
♪ 一切都在发光 ♪

06:47.103 --> 06:49.689
♪ When your stocking's
overflowing ♪
♪ 当你的袜子
满溢♪

06:49.724 --> 06:53.000
♪ And Santa's gifts
are wrapped under the tree ♪
♪ 还有圣诞老人的礼物
被包裹在树下♪

06:53.068 --> 06:58.137
- ♪ Yeah, Santa left
his gifts for you and me ♪
- ♪ 是的，圣诞老人离开了
他给你和我的礼物♪

06:58.206 --> 07:01.724
[cheers and applause]
[欢呼和掌声]

07:01.793 --> 07:05.000
- I'm dreaming
of a green Christmas.
- 我在做梦
的绿色圣诞节。

07:05.068 --> 07:06.275
Whoo-hoo!
呼呼！

07:06.379 --> 07:08.931
- And I'm dreaming
of a bah humbug.
- 我在做梦
一个呸骗子。

07:09.034 --> 07:11.344
Good day, sir.
美好的一天，先生。

07:12.517 --> 07:14.793
- Hmm.
- 唔。

07:14.862 --> 07:16.551
Come on down
to my treedome tonight
下来吧
今晚到我的树顶

07:16.620 --> 07:18.931
for a big Christmas surprise.
给你一个圣诞大惊喜。

07:19.000 --> 07:22.793
[cheers and applause]
[欢呼和掌声]

07:25.206 --> 07:28.586
- So, sis, what exactly
is this surprise
- 那么，姐姐，到底是什么
这就是惊喜吗

07:28.689 --> 07:30.206
you keep going on about?
你继续说下去吗？

07:30.275 --> 07:31.620
Or are you giving everybody
或者你给每个人

07:31.724 --> 07:33.586
the old snake oil for Christmas?
圣诞节用老蛇油？

07:33.620 --> 07:35.034
- [growls]
- Whoa! [grunts]
- [咆哮]
- 哇！ [咕哝]

07:35.103 --> 07:36.931
- This ain't no scam, Randy.
- 这不是骗局，兰迪。

07:37.000 --> 07:38.413
Now, hold your horses.
现在，牵住你的马。

07:38.448 --> 07:40.000
I'm almost finished.
我快完成了。

07:40.068 --> 07:43.896
I'll just add the extra
ingredients I collected today.
我只添加额外的
我今天收集的食材。

07:43.965 --> 07:46.793
And voilà.
瞧。

07:46.862 --> 07:48.793
- Ooh!
- Wow!
- 哦！
- 哇！

07:48.896 --> 07:50.137
- Yee-haw!
- 哎呀！

07:50.241 --> 07:52.965
It's finally ready...
and just in time.
终于准备好了...
而且恰逢其时。

07:53.068 --> 07:55.068
All my friends
will be here tonight,
我所有的朋友
今晚将会在这里，

07:55.103 --> 07:58.586
and I want to make this
Christmas special for them.
我想做这个
圣诞节对他们来说很特别。

07:58.655 --> 08:02.137
- I reckon we can help you
impress the fins off this town.
- 我想我们可以帮助你
给这个小镇的鳍留下深刻的印象。

08:02.172 --> 08:06.482
After all, special
is our specialty.
毕竟特别
是我们的专长。

08:06.551 --> 08:09.310
Mm-hmm.
- You really mean it?
嗯嗯。
- 你真的是这个意思吗？

08:09.413 --> 08:10.793
Thanks, y'all.
谢谢你们。

08:10.862 --> 08:14.689
- We got a holiday stunt
spectacular to rehearse.
- 我们有一个假期特技
排练起来很壮观。

08:14.758 --> 08:18.241
[laughter]
[笑声]

08:18.310 --> 08:20.931
[festive music]
[节日音乐]

08:21.000 --> 08:22.793
[indistinct chatter]
[模糊的喋喋不休]

08:22.862 --> 08:25.103
- Merry Christmas, y'all.
- 圣诞快乐，大家。

08:25.172 --> 08:27.413
- Merry Christmas, Sandy.
- 圣诞快乐，桑迪。

08:27.482 --> 08:30.172
Say, did you gather us here
for some kind
说吧，你把我们聚集到这里了吗？
对于某种

08:30.275 --> 08:33.655
of big Christmas surprise?
圣诞大惊喜？

08:33.724 --> 08:34.931
- [giggles]
- [咯咯笑]

08:35.000 --> 08:37.758
As a matter of fact, I did.
事实上，我做到了。

08:37.827 --> 08:42.482
- But whatever could it be,
some kind of...
- 但无论是什么，
某种...

08:42.517 --> 08:46.724
breakthrough in holiday
decorative technology?
假期突破
装饰技术？

08:46.827 --> 08:51.137
- Well, you'll just have
to see for yourselves.
- 好吧，你就会有
你自己看看吧。

08:51.206 --> 08:52.931
- Hmm?
- Huh?
- 唔？
- 啊？

08:53.000 --> 08:57.793
- I present to you
the instant Christmas tree.
- 我向你介绍
即时的圣诞树。

08:57.862 --> 09:04.758
Just a few drops of this here
yuletide concoction, and...
这里只需滴几滴
圣诞混合物，还有……

09:04.862 --> 09:09.724
whoa, a happy holiday
is all yours.
哇，节日快乐
都是你的。

09:09.827 --> 09:12.275
[cheers and applause]
[欢呼和掌声]

09:12.379 --> 09:15.724
And to help me celebrate,
my family will perform
为了帮助我庆祝，
我的家人将表演

09:15.758 --> 09:18.793
their newest stunt spectacular,
他们最新的特技表演令人惊叹，

09:18.862 --> 09:21.241
Dance of the Nutcrackers.
胡桃夹子之舞。

09:21.310 --> 09:22.310
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

09:22.379 --> 09:24.517
[magical music]
[魔幻音乐]

09:24.551 --> 09:28.344
- Ooh.
[laughter]
- 哦。
[笑声]

09:28.413 --> 09:30.586
[bluegrass version of
Tchaikovsky's "Russian Dance"]
[蓝草版本
柴可夫斯基《俄罗斯舞曲》]

09:30.655 --> 09:32.241
[boinging]
[轰鸣声]

09:32.275 --> 09:34.379
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

09:34.482 --> 09:36.724
- Hup!
- 哈！

09:36.827 --> 09:39.724
- Got you.
Hup. Yah!
- 明白了。
呵呵。啊！

09:39.827 --> 09:41.551
- Ah!
- 啊！

09:41.655 --> 09:43.896
[cannon booms]
[大炮隆隆]

09:44.000 --> 09:46.068
Ah!
[laughs]
啊!
[笑]

09:46.172 --> 09:48.517
[grunts]
[engine revving]
[咕哝]
[发动机转速]

09:48.586 --> 09:50.000
[tires squealing]
- Ooh!
[轮胎吱吱声]
- 哦！

09:50.068 --> 09:51.758
- [laughs]
- Oh!
- [笑]
- 哦！

09:51.827 --> 09:53.724
Ah!
- Yeah!
啊!
- 是的！

09:53.827 --> 09:55.172
- Here we go.
- 开始了。

09:55.241 --> 09:59.000
Whoo-whoo!
Pew-pew-pew-pew-pew-pew-pew!
呼呼！
噗噗噗噗噗噗噗噗！

10:01.000 --> 10:03.068
[magical music]
[魔幻音乐]

10:03.137 --> 10:04.413
- Ho, ho...
- 嗬嗬……

10:04.482 --> 10:07.172
[sighs] What a night.
[叹气]真是一个夜晚。

10:07.241 --> 10:12.620
Good thing my 364-day
vacation starts tomorrow.
还好我的364天
明天开始放假。

10:12.689 --> 10:16.344
Now, let's see.
现在，让我们看看。

10:16.413 --> 10:18.896
Aha, Bikini Bottom.
啊哈，比基尼泳裤。

10:19.000 --> 10:21.620
Saving the best for last.
把最好的留到最后。

10:22.827 --> 10:25.103
See you back at the North Pole.
北极见。

10:25.206 --> 10:28.379
And don't drink all my eggnog!
别把我的蛋酒都喝掉！

10:28.482 --> 10:29.620
[alarm blares]
[警报声]

10:31.827 --> 10:34.758
[festive music]
[节日音乐]

10:34.862 --> 10:37.724
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

10:37.793 --> 10:39.068
Ho, ho, ho.
嗬，嗬，嗬。

10:39.172 --> 10:41.275
A circus show?
马戏表演？

10:41.379 --> 10:43.482
Now, that's
the Christmas spirit,
现在，那就是
圣诞气氛，

10:43.551 --> 10:45.551
you party animals.
你们这些派对动物。

10:45.620 --> 10:48.275
- Oh, Santa.
- 哦，圣诞老人。

10:48.379 --> 10:50.241
- Hey, it's Santa.
Santa!
- 嘿，这是圣诞老人。
圣诞老人！

10:50.344 --> 10:52.275
[laughter]
[笑声]

10:52.379 --> 10:55.931
- Boy howdy,
that there's Santa Claus.
- 男孩你好，
那里有圣诞老人。

10:56.000 --> 11:00.482
- I reckon we ought to make
our finale extra grand for him.
- 我认为我们应该做
我们的结局对他来说格外盛大。

11:01.896 --> 11:03.689
[both chuckle]
[两人都笑了]

11:03.758 --> 11:05.137
Ah.
啊。

11:05.241 --> 11:08.137
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

11:08.241 --> 11:09.620
- Ho, ho, ho.
- 嗬，嗬，嗬。

11:09.655 --> 11:12.965
Merry Christmas, one and all.
圣诞快乐，一并。

11:13.068 --> 11:15.517
- Now this will be
a Texas-sized tree.
- 现在这将是
一棵德克萨斯州大小的树。

11:15.586 --> 11:18.413
- You know it.
[laughs]
- 你知道的。
[笑]

11:18.482 --> 11:19.413
[rumbling]
- Huh?
[隆隆声]
- 啊？

11:19.482 --> 11:20.862
Whoa!
哇！

11:20.931 --> 11:24.172
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

11:24.275 --> 11:25.482
- Whoa!
- 哇！

11:25.551 --> 11:26.758
- Ooh!
- Wow!
- 哦！
- 哇！

11:26.827 --> 11:28.965
- Ho, ho, ho.
- 嗬，嗬，嗬。

11:29.068 --> 11:30.896
Huh?
啊？

11:30.965 --> 11:32.793
Oh, Krampus.
哦，坎普斯。

11:33.896 --> 11:35.655
Ow!
[screams]
噢！
[尖叫声]

11:35.724 --> 11:37.172
[all gasp]
[全都喘气]

11:37.241 --> 11:38.379
Whoa!
哇！

11:38.448 --> 11:41.379
[grunting and shouting]
[咕哝和喊叫]

11:41.448 --> 11:42.862
Ow!
噢！

11:42.931 --> 11:45.103
Whoa, whoa, whoa!
哇哇哇！

11:45.206 --> 11:46.793
Ow!
噢！

11:46.896 --> 11:49.689
[all groaning]
[全都呻吟]

11:49.758 --> 11:52.448
Whoa!
哇！

11:52.517 --> 11:55.068
[squeaking]
[吱吱声]

11:55.137 --> 11:59.793
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

11:59.896 --> 12:01.758
[groans]
[呻吟]

12:01.827 --> 12:04.896
- [gasps]
- [whimpers]
- [喘气]
- [呜咽]

12:05.000 --> 12:06.206
- Oh, my.
- 哦，天哪。

12:06.310 --> 12:08.793
I hope he isn't too hurt.
我希望他没有太受伤。

12:08.862 --> 12:10.137
[chuckles]
[笑声]

12:11.482 --> 12:12.586
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

12:12.655 --> 12:15.793
Santa, talk to me, big fella.
圣诞老人，跟我说话吧，大家伙。

12:15.827 --> 12:17.620
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

12:17.689 --> 12:22.862
Mrs. Claus, the Easter Bunny
is here to see you.
克劳斯夫人，复活节兔子
来见你了。

12:22.965 --> 12:24.413
- Oh, that ain't good.
=> - 哦，那不好。

12:24.482 --> 12:25.689
Come on, Santa.
来吧，圣诞老人。

12:25.758 --> 12:27.655
Don't you know what day it is?
你不知道今天是什么日子吗？

12:27.724 --> 12:29.000
- Of course.
- 当然。

12:29.034 --> 12:31.793
Happy Valentine's Day!
情人节快乐！

12:31.862 --> 12:34.034
Mwah.
[groans]
哇。
[呻吟]

12:34.137 --> 12:35.655
- Oh.
- Oh, boy.
- 哦。
- 哦，男孩。

12:35.724 --> 12:38.482
- That old elf is one sugarplum
shy of a fruitcake.
- 那个老精灵是一颗糖梅
害羞的水果蛋糕。

12:38.517 --> 12:39.896
- Yeah, bro.
- 是的，兄弟。

12:39.965 --> 12:43.310
How is Santa gonna deliver
our presents now?
圣诞老人要怎样送礼物
我们的礼物现在呢？

12:43.379 --> 12:44.758
- He's not.
- 他不是。

12:44.827 --> 12:47.000
Sandy knocked him
right out of the sky
桑迪撞倒了他
就在天上

12:47.103 --> 12:49.206
with her big dumb tree.
和她那棵愚蠢的大树。

12:49.310 --> 12:54.000
- That's exactly
why I don't trust trees.
- 正是如此
为什么我不相信树。

12:54.103 --> 12:56.655
- But what's the point
of having Christmas
- 但这有什么意义
过圣诞节的时候

12:56.724 --> 12:59.379
without any presents?
没有任何礼物？

12:59.482 --> 13:02.724
- You, like,
totally ruined Christmas.
- 你喜欢，
完全毁了圣诞节。

13:02.827 --> 13:04.896
[crying]
[哭泣]

13:05.000 --> 13:06.724
[all grumbling]
[大家都在抱怨]

13:08.241 --> 13:09.724
- Oh, no.
- 哦，不。

13:09.758 --> 13:11.413
This is all my fault.
这都是我的错。

13:11.517 --> 13:13.413
I'm so sorry, y'all.
我很抱歉，你们。

13:13.517 --> 13:15.275
- It'll be OK, Sandy.
- 会没事的，桑迪。

13:15.344 --> 13:17.931
At least Santa's
having a good time.
至少是圣诞老人的
玩得很开心。

13:18.000 --> 13:19.896
- Hey, where are you going?
- 嘿，你要去哪里？

13:19.965 --> 13:22.103
The party's just
getting started.
聚会只是
开始使用。

13:22.172 --> 13:24.448
[party horn toots]
Whoa!
[派对号角声]
哇！

13:24.517 --> 13:25.620
[party horn toots]
[派对号角声]

13:25.689 --> 13:27.620
- Oh!
- 哦！

13:27.724 --> 13:31.448
- And so the town
went quiet that night.
- 所以这个小镇
那天晚上很安静。

13:31.551 --> 13:34.827
One by one,
they put out their lights.
一一，
他们熄灭了灯。

13:34.896 --> 13:38.724
No fun to be had,
no joy to be doing,
没有乐趣可言，
做事没有乐趣，

13:38.758 --> 13:43.620
just the soft, sad sounds
of gentle boo-hooing.
只是柔和、悲伤的声音
温柔的嘘声。

13:43.689 --> 13:47.103
- [howls]
- [嚎叫]

13:47.206 --> 13:50.103
[soft ukulele music playing]
[轻柔的尤克里里音乐演奏]

13:50.172 --> 13:53.413
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

13:53.517 --> 13:57.896
- ♪ Oh, I should be
eating pumpkin pie ♪
- ♪ 哦，我应该是
吃南瓜派♪

13:58.000 --> 14:02.034
♪ But instead
I made the whole town cry ♪
♪ 但相反
我让整个小镇都哭了♪

14:02.103 --> 14:05.172
♪ What in the world
was I doing ♪
♪ 世界上有什么
我在做什么♪

14:05.275 --> 14:08.068
♪ Now Christmas is ruined ♪
♪ 现在圣诞节被毁了 ♪

14:08.137 --> 14:11.896
♪ I got the Christmas blues ♪
♪ 我感受到了圣诞忧郁 ♪

14:11.965 --> 14:15.827
♪ I feel like
I just don't belong ♪
♪ 我感觉
我只是不属于♪

14:15.862 --> 14:20.896
♪ Wish that I could sing
a happy song ♪
♪ 希望我能唱歌
一首快乐的歌♪

14:20.965 --> 14:22.931
♪ Guess I'll just
sit here and stew ♪
♪ 我想我会
坐在这里炖菜♪

14:23.000 --> 14:26.413
♪ And keep a-weeping boo-hoo ♪
♪ 继续哭泣 ♪

14:26.482 --> 14:31.620
♪ I got the Christmas blues ♪
♪ 我感受到了圣诞忧郁 ♪

14:31.689 --> 14:34.586
[bluesy harmonica music playing]
[蓝调口琴演奏]

14:34.620 --> 14:37.689
♪
♪
♪
♪

14:37.793 --> 14:41.172
- Oh, if only
some unexpected fortune
- 哦，如果只是
一些意外的幸运

14:41.241 --> 14:43.310
would just appear from above.
只会从上面出现。

14:43.344 --> 14:44.551
- Hey, kin!
- 嘿，亲戚！

14:44.620 --> 14:47.586
- Look what we found!
- 看看我们发现了什么！

14:47.655 --> 14:50.103
- It's all Santa's gifts,
I tell you.
- 这都是圣诞老人的礼物，
我告诉你。

14:50.137 --> 14:51.344
- Sure is.
- 当然是。

14:51.413 --> 14:52.965
Can we keep them?
我们可以保留它们吗？

14:53.068 --> 14:54.655
- Ooh, did you hear that, Sandy?
- 哦，你听到了吗，桑迪？

14:54.724 --> 14:57.689
An unexpected fortune
just appeared from above.
意外的财富
刚刚从上面出现。

14:57.758 --> 14:59.689
- Hold your seahorses,
SpongeBob.
- 握住你的海马，
海绵宝宝。

14:59.758 --> 15:03.379
Ain't no use having gifts
if Santa can't deliver them.
有礼物没有用
如果圣诞老人无法送出它们。

15:03.448 --> 15:05.793
- She's right, SpongeBob.
- 她是对的，海绵宝宝。

15:05.862 --> 15:08.689
Santa's still indisposed.
圣诞老人还是不舒服。

15:08.724 --> 15:10.344
- [barking like a seal]
- [像海豹一样吠叫]

15:10.379 --> 15:13.517
- Meaning Christmas
is still ruined.
- 意味着圣诞节
仍然被毁了。

15:13.620 --> 15:14.965
[chomps]
[咀嚼]

15:15.034 --> 15:18.275
[high-pitched screeching]
[both groan]
[高亢的尖叫声]
[两人都呻吟]

15:18.344 --> 15:19.965
- [clears throat]
- [清喉咙]

15:20.034 --> 15:23.724
This ain't the first time
we had a year without Santa.
这不是第一次
我们度过了没有圣诞老人的一年。

15:23.827 --> 15:29.068
I remember
the Great Elf Strike of 1874.
我记得
1874 年精灵大罢工。

15:29.137 --> 15:32.241
Our whole town was real blue
that Christmas,
我们的整个城镇都是真正的蓝色
那个圣诞节，

15:32.310 --> 15:34.034
but we made the most of it.
但我们充分利用了它。

15:34.068 --> 15:36.137
No Santa, no problem.
没有圣诞老人，没问题。

15:36.206 --> 15:39.103
We Cheeks banded together
and exchanged gifts
我们脸颊绑在一起
并交换了礼物

15:39.172 --> 15:41.000
all on our own.
一切都靠我们自己。

15:41.068 --> 15:43.000
The family Cheeks
ain't quitters.
脸颊家族
不是放弃者。

15:43.068 --> 15:45.689
We weren't then,
and we ain't now.
那时我们还没有，
而我们现在不是。

15:45.793 --> 15:47.172
- Granny's right.
- 奶奶是对的。

15:47.241 --> 15:49.482
Let's do this for Santa.
让我们为圣诞老人做这件事吧。

15:49.551 --> 15:51.586
[all cheering]
- ♪ Row, row, row your boat ♪
[大家欢呼]
- ♪ 划，划，划你的船 ♪

15:51.655 --> 15:53.827
♪ Gently down the stream ♪
♪ 轻轻顺流而下 ♪

15:53.896 --> 15:55.724
[bluegrass version of
Tchaikovsky's "Russian Dance"]
[蓝草版本
柴可夫斯基《俄罗斯舞曲》]

15:55.793 --> 15:57.448
- Come on.
You can do it.
- 快点。
你可以做到的。

15:57.517 --> 15:59.896
Uh-huh.
- [grunts]
嗯嗯。
- [咕哝]

16:00.000 --> 16:01.655
- Giddyap, giddyap,
giddyap, giddyap.
- 吉德亚普，吉德亚普，
吉德亚普，吉德亚普。

16:01.724 --> 16:02.862
[groans]
- [gasps]
[呻吟]
- [喘气]

16:02.931 --> 16:04.000
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

16:04.068 --> 16:05.620
- Huh?
- 啊？

16:05.724 --> 16:09.206
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

16:09.275 --> 16:10.827
- Ooh, lookee.
- 哦，瞧。

16:10.896 --> 16:12.344
[gibbering]
- [gasps] Oh, dear.
[胡言乱语]
- [喘气]哦，亲爱的。

16:12.413 --> 16:13.413
- Whoa!
- 哇！

16:13.482 --> 16:15.103
[jellyfish buzzing]
[水母嗡嗡声]

16:15.206 --> 16:16.689
- [buzzing] Ho, ho, ho.
- [嗡嗡声] 嗬，嗬，嗬。

16:16.758 --> 16:19.931
- [humming "Jingle Bells"]
- [哼着《铃儿响叮当》]

16:20.034 --> 16:22.275
Huh?
[groans, screams]
啊？
[呻吟，尖叫]

16:22.379 --> 16:23.344
- [gibbering]
- [胡言乱语]

16:23.413 --> 16:24.896
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

16:24.965 --> 16:26.172
[birds tweeting]
[鸟鸣声]

16:26.241 --> 16:28.620
- Ugh.
[laughs nervously]
- 呃。
[紧张地笑]

16:28.724 --> 16:33.896
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

16:33.965 --> 16:35.689
- Looking good.
- 看起来不错。

16:35.758 --> 16:36.689
- Whoo-hoo!
- 呼呼！

16:36.758 --> 16:39.241
[foghorn blares]
[雾号声]

16:39.275 --> 16:42.758
[laughter]
[笑声]

16:42.793 --> 16:44.034
[engine turning over]
[发动机转动]

16:44.103 --> 16:46.344
[horn honking "La Cucaracha']
[按喇叭“La Cucaracha”]

16:46.413 --> 16:47.482
- Whoo!
- 呼！

16:47.551 --> 16:48.931
- [gibbering]
- [胡言乱语]

16:49.034 --> 16:52.241
Good luck delivering
those Easter eggs.
祝交付顺利
那些复活节彩蛋。

16:52.344 --> 16:54.034
Mwah.
哇。

16:54.103 --> 16:57.413
[all cheering]
[大家欢呼]

16:57.448 --> 16:58.758
- Now, Sandy.
- 现在，桑迪。

16:58.862 --> 16:59.862
Now, Randy.
现在，兰迪。

16:59.931 --> 17:02.034
Now, Rowdy and Rosy.
现在，罗迪和罗西。

17:02.103 --> 17:06.413
On Ma, on Pa, on Granny, and...
在妈妈身上，在爸爸身上，在奶奶身上，还有……

17:06.482 --> 17:09.137
oh, me.
哦，我。

17:09.241 --> 17:10.758
[laughs]
[笑]

17:10.827 --> 17:13.724
[all laughing and cheering]
[大家欢笑和欢呼]

17:13.827 --> 17:16.172
- I think we need
a little musical motivation
- 我认为我们需要
一点音乐动机

17:16.241 --> 17:18.758
to get this job done.
完成这项工作。

17:18.827 --> 17:20.517
- ♪ Well ♪
- ♪ 嗯 ♪

17:20.586 --> 17:22.758
- ♪ Christmas is a time
for giving ♪
- ♪ 圣诞节是一个美好的时光
为了给予♪

17:22.827 --> 17:24.448
♪ Christmas is a time
for getting ♪
♪ 圣诞节是一个美好的时光
为了得到♪

17:24.517 --> 17:27.965
♪ Christmas is a time
for many things ♪
♪ 圣诞节是一个美好的时光
对于很多事情♪

17:28.034 --> 17:30.344
- ♪ And you know
we like carol singing ♪
- ♪ 你知道
我们喜欢卡罗尔唱歌♪

17:30.413 --> 17:32.344
♪ Skating round
and jellyfishing ♪
♪ 轮滑
还有捕水母♪

17:32.448 --> 17:35.931
♪ But nothing beats
our nutty family ♪
♪ 但没有什么比
我们的疯狂家族♪

17:36.000 --> 17:38.275
- [yodeling]
- [岳得尔调]

17:38.344 --> 17:40.344
♪ Giving gifts means
I love you ♪
♪ 送礼物意味着
我爱你♪

17:40.448 --> 17:43.620
♪ But not like spending time
so happily, hee-hee ♪
♪ 但不喜欢花时间
太幸福了，嘻嘻♪

17:43.689 --> 17:45.482
- ♪ At Christmastime
both: ♪ At Christmastime ♪
- ♪ 圣诞节期间
两人：♪ 圣诞节期间 ♪

17:45.517 --> 17:47.793
- ♪ Everything's fine
both: ♪ Everything's fine
- ♪ 一切都很好
两人：♪ 一切都很好

17:47.862 --> 17:50.620
- ♪ 'Cause we got everything
we'll ever need ♪
- ♪ 因为我们拥有了一切
我们永远需要♪

17:50.689 --> 17:52.103
both: ♪ We'll ever need ♪
两人：♪ 我们永远需要 ♪

17:52.172 --> 17:54.206
- ♪ We may be miles apart ♪
- ♪ 我们可能相距数英里 ♪

17:54.310 --> 17:55.965
♪ But you know in my heart ♪
♪ 但你心里知道 ♪

17:56.034 --> 17:58.793
♪ This nut don't fall far
from the family tree ♪
♪ 这颗坚果不会掉得太远
从家谱上看♪

17:58.827 --> 17:59.931
- ♪ Yee-haw
- ♪ 呀呀

18:00.000 --> 18:02.241
♪ Places, y'all,
and here we go ♪
♪ 地方，你们，
我们开始吧♪

18:02.344 --> 18:04.137
♪ Round and round
and turn to the right ♪
♪ 圆圆的
然后向右转♪

18:04.206 --> 18:06.103
♪ It's Christmas Eve,
it should be bright ♪
♪ 今天是圣诞夜，
应该很亮吧♪

18:06.206 --> 18:07.896
♪ The Krusty Krab
looks mighty low ♪
♪ 蟹堡王
看起来好低沉♪

18:07.965 --> 18:09.965
♪ Come on, SpongeBob,
let's do-si-do ♪
♪ 来吧，海绵宝宝，
让我们做事做吧♪

18:10.034 --> 18:12.000
- ♪ I'm so blue
- ♪ I feel the same ♪
- ♪ 我好蓝
- ♪ 我也有同感 ♪

18:12.068 --> 18:14.137
- ♪ No Christmas gifts
- ♪ Dad, this is lame ♪
- ♪ 没有圣诞礼物
- ♪ 爸爸，这太蹩脚了 ♪

18:14.206 --> 18:15.862
- ♪ Now, folks, don't worry,
and don't you fear ♪
- ♪ 现在，伙计们，别担心，
你不害怕吗♪

18:15.931 --> 18:17.862
♪ Your Christmas gifts
will soon be here ♪
♪ 你的圣诞礼物
很快就到了♪

18:17.931 --> 18:19.689
♪ But there is something
you must do ♪
♪ 但有件事
你必须这样做♪

18:19.758 --> 18:21.862
♪ Or old Saint Nick
won't visit you ♪
♪ 或者老圣尼克
不会来看你♪

18:21.931 --> 18:23.931
♪ Good crabs and whales
should be asleep ♪
♪ 好螃蟹和鲸鱼
应该睡着了♪

18:24.034 --> 18:25.896
♪ No gifts
unless you're counting sheep ♪
♪ 没有礼物
除非你在数羊♪

18:25.965 --> 18:28.068
♪ So bow to your partner,
go on ahead ♪
♪ 所以向你的伴侣鞠躬，
继续前进♪

18:28.103 --> 18:30.931
♪ Knock yourself out
and go to bed ♪
♪ 打倒自己
然后去睡觉吧♪

18:31.000 --> 18:32.068
[boinging]
[轰鸣声]

18:32.172 --> 18:34.000
[bright bluegrass music]
[明亮的蓝草音乐]

18:34.068 --> 18:36.000
♪ Now allemande left
and fly like a bluebird ♪
♪ 现在阿勒曼德离开了
像蓝鸟一样飞翔♪

18:36.068 --> 18:37.965
♪ Randy and Granny
to the house of Squidward ♪
♪ 兰迪和奶奶
去章鱼哥的家♪

18:38.034 --> 18:39.724
♪ Walk on your tiptoes,
give him his gift ♪
♪ 踮着脚尖走路，
给他礼物♪

18:39.793 --> 18:41.827
♪ Don't wake him up, now,
better be swift ♪
♪ 现在别叫醒他，
最好快点♪

18:41.896 --> 18:43.655
- ♪ But what's that noise,
holy mackerel ♪
- ♪ 但是那是什么声音，
圣鲭鱼♪

18:43.724 --> 18:45.413
- ♪ Dagnabbit,
that sound ain't natural ♪
- ♪ 达格纳比特，
那声音不自然♪

18:45.517 --> 18:46.689
[clarinet wailing]
[单簧管哀号]

18:46.758 --> 18:49.620
♪ Sure ain't no silent night ♪
♪ 夜晚当然不寂静 ♪

18:49.724 --> 18:51.758
♪ Squeaks and honks
and clarinet squawks ♪
♪ 吱吱声和喇叭声
和单簧管的嘎嘎声♪

18:51.827 --> 18:54.517
♪ Stop that noise
with Christmas socks ♪
♪ 别再吵了
搭配圣诞袜♪

18:54.586 --> 18:57.448
[muffled off-key notes playing]
[低沉的走调音符演奏]

18:57.551 --> 18:59.413
♪ Now, Rowdy's next
and Rosie too ♪
♪ 现在，下一个是罗迪
还有罗西♪

18:59.517 --> 19:01.586
♪ To Patrick Star's
we skip to my Lou ♪
♪ 前往帕特里克·斯塔 (Patrick Star)
我们跳到我的卢 ♪

19:01.655 --> 19:03.379
♪ Now, sneak, sneak,
don't make a squeak ♪
♪ 现在，潜行，潜行，
别发出吱吱声♪

19:03.448 --> 19:05.586
♪ That's a big old gift,
and it's starting to leak ♪
♪ 这是一份古老的大礼物，
开始漏水了♪

19:05.655 --> 19:07.655
- ♪ It's sand, sand
both: ♪ Everywhere ♪
- ♪ 这是沙子，沙子
两者：♪ 无处不在 ♪

19:07.758 --> 19:09.862
- ♪ Too late now,
better hop on a chair ♪
- ♪ 现在太晚了，
better hop on a chair ♪

19:09.965 --> 19:11.724
- ♪ This Christmas gift
is mighty quirky ♪
- ♪ 这个圣诞礼物
非常古怪♪

19:11.793 --> 19:14.137
- ♪ That's OK,
I think Pat likes turkey ♪
- ♪ 没关系，
我觉得帕特喜欢火鸡 ♪

19:14.172 --> 19:15.482
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

19:15.551 --> 19:17.551
- ♪ Come on, kids,
you're doing fine ♪
- ♪ 来吧，孩子们，
你过得很好♪

19:17.620 --> 19:18.758
♪ The next stop is ♪
♪ 下一站是 ♪

19:18.793 --> 19:20.827
[gasps]
We're out of time.
[喘气]
我们没时间了。

19:20.931 --> 19:22.551
We'll never finish delivering
我们永远不会完成交付

19:22.620 --> 19:26.241
all these gifts
to Bikini Bottom.
所有这些礼物
到比基尼底部。

19:26.310 --> 19:28.275
- Aunt Sandy?
- 桑迪阿姨？

19:28.344 --> 19:30.862
- We brought along
that concoction you made.
- 我们带来了
你做的混合物。

19:30.931 --> 19:32.379
Maybe it'll help.
也许会有帮助。

19:32.448 --> 19:34.448
- Oh, it ain't gonna work.
- 哦，这是行不通的。

19:34.517 --> 19:37.413
It's running short
on Christmas cheer.
所剩无几了
在圣诞节的欢呼声中。

19:37.482 --> 19:39.827
- Well, we can fix that,
right, family?
- 好吧，我们可以解决这个问题，
对吧，家人？

19:39.931 --> 19:41.448
- Yeah!
- ♪ Bum-bum-bum ♪
- 是的！
- ♪ 呜呜呜 ♪

19:41.517 --> 19:45.172
- ♪ Christmas will come,
and Christmas will go ♪
- ♪ 圣诞节即将来临，
圣诞节即将过去♪

19:45.241 --> 19:49.482
♪ What stays are the days
that we say I love you so ♪
♪ 留下的是日子
我们说我如此爱你♪

19:49.517 --> 19:53.000
♪ Everything's a-glowing when
your stocking's overflowing ♪
♪ 一切都在发光
你的袜子已经满溢了♪

19:53.034 --> 19:55.655
♪ And Santa's gifts
are wrapped under the tree ♪
♪ 还有圣诞老人的礼物
被包裹在树下♪

19:55.724 --> 19:57.413
- I love you guys.
- Yes.
- 我爱你们。
- 是的。

19:57.482 --> 20:00.379
- ♪ Gifts are so much better
when your family is together ♪
- ♪ 礼物好多了
当你和家人在一起的时候♪

20:00.448 --> 20:02.310
- Ooh! Ho, ho, ho!
- 哦！嗬，嗬，嗬！

20:02.379 --> 20:04.724
- ♪ Whether it's on land
or in the sea ♪
- ♪ 无论是在陆地上
或者在海里♪

20:04.793 --> 20:10.931
♪ Oh, a holiday with you
is right for me ♪
♪ 哦，和你一起度假
适合我♪

20:12.068 --> 20:13.586
- Yee-haw!
- 哎呀！

20:13.655 --> 20:15.413
We made it just in time.
我们来得正是时候。

20:15.482 --> 20:18.275
[all cheering]
[大家欢呼]

20:20.758 --> 20:23.068
- Ooh, I have to tell Santa.
- 哦，我得告诉圣诞老人。

20:23.137 --> 20:24.482
Santa!
圣诞老人！

20:24.551 --> 20:26.172
- [yelps, gibbers]
- [尖叫声，胡言乱语]

20:26.275 --> 20:28.000
What the... where am I?
这……我这是在哪儿？

20:28.103 --> 20:30.172
- We saved Christmas.
- 我们拯救了圣诞节。

20:30.241 --> 20:31.344
- Huh?
- 啊？

20:31.448 --> 20:33.724
- Well, actually,
we ruined Christmas.
- 嗯，实际上，
我们毁了圣诞节。

20:33.793 --> 20:35.275
But then we saved it.
但后来我们保存了它。

20:35.344 --> 20:38.620
[squeaking]
[吱吱声]

20:38.689 --> 20:40.034
- What happened?
- 发生了什么？

20:40.103 --> 20:41.448
[peaceful music]
[平静的音乐]

20:41.482 --> 20:43.034
Give me that.
- [laughs]
给我那个。
- [笑]

20:43.103 --> 20:46.655
- The last thing I remember
was a big Christmas tree.
- 我记得的最后一件事
是一棵大圣诞树。

20:46.689 --> 20:50.275
- Then you fell
on your rum-pum-pum-pum.
- 然后你就摔倒了
在你的朗姆酒上。

20:50.344 --> 20:52.482
[laughs]
- We thought you was dead.
[笑]
- 我们以为你死了。

20:52.551 --> 20:54.965
- [laughs nervously]
But you're fine now.
- [紧张地笑]
但你现在很好。

20:55.034 --> 20:57.793
And we took care
of your Christmas presents.
我们照顾了
你的圣诞礼物。

20:57.862 --> 21:00.551
- This means I'm off
the naughty list, right?
- 这意味着我要走了
淘气名单，对吧？

21:00.655 --> 21:01.965
[crickets chirping]
[蟋蟀鸣叫]

21:02.034 --> 21:04.241
- Oh, you fixed my sleigh.
- 哦，你修好了我的雪橇。

21:04.275 --> 21:05.965
Oh, thank you, everyone.
噢，谢谢大家。

21:06.034 --> 21:10.000
You all deserve
special presents from Santa.
你们都值得
来自圣诞老人的特别礼物。

21:10.068 --> 21:11.068
Let's see.
让我们来看看。

21:11.103 --> 21:13.689
How's this?
这怎么样？

21:13.758 --> 21:17.068
- Appreciate it, Santa,
but I already got what I wanted
- 谢谢你，圣诞老人，
但我已经得到了我想要的

21:17.137 --> 21:18.551
for Christmas this year.
今年圣诞节。

21:18.620 --> 21:20.827
- We never needed nothing fancy.
- 我们从来不需要任何花哨的东西。

21:20.896 --> 21:21.931
- Yeah.
- 是的。

21:22.000 --> 21:23.517
Who needs presents, anyway?
到底谁需要礼物？

21:23.586 --> 21:27.448
- Well, we're, like,
totally grateful for ours.
- 嗯，我们就像，
完全感谢我们的。

21:27.517 --> 21:29.344
- How'd you know it was us?
- 你怎么知道是我们？

21:29.413 --> 21:33.344
- Well, we found a little
squirrel fur on our gifts.
- 嗯，我们发现了一点
我们的礼物上有松鼠毛。

21:33.413 --> 21:35.103
[blows sharply]
[猛烈地吹]

21:35.206 --> 21:38.482
- You were also yodeling
on our rooftops all night.
- 你也唱过约德尔歌
整晚都在我们的屋顶上。

21:38.551 --> 21:41.068
- But we all thank you
nonetheless.
- 但我们都谢谢你
尽管如此。

21:41.172 --> 21:42.620
- No need to thank us.
- 不用感谢我们。

21:42.689 --> 21:46.620
What's important
is that we're all together.
什么是重要的
就是我们都在一起。

21:46.689 --> 21:50.103
- Uh-huh, but we also got
this big old tree.
- 嗯嗯，但我们也得到了
这棵大老树。

21:50.206 --> 21:52.275
Sandy got it souped up for us.
桑迪为我们做好了准备。

21:52.344 --> 21:55.310
- Figured y'all could
use it as a new house.
- 我想你们都可以
将其用作新房。

21:55.379 --> 21:57.172
[excited chatter]
[兴奋的喋喋不休]

21:57.241 --> 21:58.344
- Here we come!
- 我们来了！

21:58.413 --> 22:01.517
- Now, that
is a Christmas present.
- 现在，那个
是一份圣诞礼物。

22:01.586 --> 22:05.793
Seeing y'all was great,
but nothing beats free stuff.
见到你们真是太棒了
但没有什么比免费的东西更好的了。

22:05.896 --> 22:07.000
[laughs]
[笑]

22:07.068 --> 22:09.413
- Now, let's get
this Texas-sized tree
- 现在，让我们开始吧
这棵德克萨斯州大小的树

22:09.482 --> 22:12.275
back where it belongs, Texas.
回到它所属的地方，德克萨斯州。

22:12.344 --> 22:15.137
- Yee-haw!
[laughter]
- 哎呀！
[笑声]

22:15.241 --> 22:16.689
Yee-haw!
呀呀！

22:16.758 --> 22:20.862
All: Bye.
Merry Christmas.
全体：再见。
圣诞快乐。

22:20.965 --> 22:25.172
- And that is the story of how
a family of nutty squirrels
- 这就是如何的故事
一群坚果松鼠

22:25.275 --> 22:30.206
ruined and then saved Christmas
down in the deep blue sea.
毁了圣诞节又拯救了圣诞节
在深蓝色的大海里。

22:30.275 --> 22:33.586
I know. I know.
I hardly believe it myself.
我知道。我知道。
我自己都很难相信。

22:33.655 --> 22:36.379
All:
Merry Christmas, y'all.
全部：
圣诞快乐，大家。

22:36.448 --> 22:38.793
- Whoo-hoo!
- [laughs]
- 呼呼！
- [笑]

22:40.586 --> 22:43.068
- You all come back, now.
You hear?
- 你们都回来吧，现在。
你听到了吗？

22:43.137 --> 22:45.172
[bell dings, seagulls squawking]
[钟声叮叮，海鸥嘎嘎叫]

[钟声叮叮，海鸥嘎嘎叫]